      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ORARA JAKO (4) was well fancied to win maiden two back then finished second last start (20.39) at this track over 350m. Returns to the course where he won his maiden. Expected to feature in the finish again. SPITFIRE REIGN (5) is worth forgiving last start after finishing sixth (20.45) from Box 7 at this track over 350m. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. RUBY SHELBY (8) goes very well this course and distance starting 12 times for four wins and five minors. Was out of the placings last time (21.21) at this track in a Grade 5, finishing seventh and beaten 14 lengths. Can feature with the right run. LUCKY BOY BLUE (2) should be thereabouts after filling a top-three spot most recently.",
